%% title: Guardian: who does what
%% desc: News from the Teacher, Accountant, Exam controller and Admin reaches the guardian on the portal; the guardian sends applications to the school.
flowchart LR
  gua["Guardian"]:::me
  tea["Teacher"]
  por["Portal<br/>(guardian,<br/>student)"]:::view
  acc["Accountant"]
  exam["Exam<br/>controller"]
  admin["Admin"]
  off["Office<br/>staff"]
  tea -->|"Attendance, homework"| por
  acc -->|"Bills, invoices"| por
